<http://data.silknow.org/object/7a106a13-1e17-3806-9f24-e8461ee46c54/observation/1>
        a                   crmsci:S4_Observation ;
        ecrm:P2_has_type    <http://data.silknow.org/observation/technical-observation> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Carved wooden doll , coated in gesso and overpainted. Inset lozenge eyes in black and white glass. Blonde human hair wig. Dressed and styled as a man, wearing a olive coloured three-piece suit - coat, waistcoat and breeches in corded silk with silver wire covered buttons, over a white linen shirt edged with lace at the neck and wrists. Knitted cream silk stockings tied at the knee with red and white striped silk garters, probably a later addition, and brown leather shoes"@en ;
        crmsci:O8_observed  <http://data.silknow.org/object/7a106a13-1e17-3806-9f24-e8461ee46c54> .

